    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides support for representing a failure result, or a valid value of type <computeroutput>T</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows for integrating with <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_logical_result" kindref="compound">LogicalResult</ref>, while also providing a value on the success path. </para>
